  "revision_note": "Cases 0-14 and their original expected_rules/label_attack are the frozen 2026-10-21 baseline. expected_rules_after_fix records the deterministic behaviour change of detection-fix rule version 2 (staggered windows, 5xx split) for three cases only; intent labels were not changed. Cases 15-17 were added afterwards. expected_strongest_decision / expected_enforcement_requests describe the policy stage with every policy promoted to class automatic and bridge modes automatic and propose configured. Cases 18-20 (hourly SSH rule) were added with ssh_bruteforce_slow v1; their expected_strongest_decision values are taken from the first real run of the policy stage and reviewed, not chosen to make a gate pass."
